## Learning Captured (For PEFS Phase 2)

**Pattern Observations:**
1. **Low dopamine tasks** (recruitment posts, cron setup) → Best to SCHEDULE short blocks
2. **Creative tasks** (demo video) → Need dedicated time (2-hour blocks)
3. **Technical debt** (MCP bug) → Archive to batch sprint, don't ad-hoc debug
4. **Unclear status items** (GentleQuest tests) → Archive for audit, don't guess
5. **Strategy paralysis** (marketing) → Kill strategy, schedule ONE execution item

**These patterns will inform:**
- Context-aware routing (Phase 2)
- Template library (Phase 2)
- Auto-suggest logic (Phase 2)

